        "route": "/materials/common/metals/antimony-ingot",
        "body": "# Antimony Ingot\n\n## Effect\nAntimony Ingots are brittle but structurally influential, used to reinforce alloys and improve the rigidity of softer metals.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Alloy reinforcement\n- Structural balancing in metal crafting\n- Artificer and alchemical components\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Brittle and rigid  \n- Not suitable for direct weapon or armor crafting  \n- Improves hardness and form retention in alloys  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- [[Pewter Ingot]]\n- Advanced alloy systems (future)\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Enhances durability of enchanted structures  \n- Reduces warping under magical stress  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Antimony Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Strength is not always what stands — but what prevents collapse.\"*"
