        "body": "# Copper Ingot\n\n## Effect\nA refined metal with excellent conductivity, Copper Ingots are widely used in crafting tools, enchantment bases, and early-stage equipment.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Used in:\n  - Basic weapons\n  - Magical conduits\n  - Artificer components\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Soft and easily shaped  \n- Low durability under stress  \n- High energy conductivity  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- [[Bronze Ingot]] (with Tin)\n- [[Brass Ingot]] (with Zinc)\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Boosts Fire and Lightning effects  \n- Improves low-tier enchantment stability  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Copper Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Refined from flame, shaped by will.\"*"
