        "route": "/materials/rare/metals/moonstone-ingot",
        "body": "# Moonstone Ingot\n\n## Effect\nMoonstone Ingots produce a refined metal that harmonises magical energy, making it ideal for balanced builds that combine offense, defense, and spellcasting.\n\n---\n## Appearance\nMoonstone Ingots are refined into smooth, softly luminous bars with a pearlescent sheen. The surface reflects light in shifting tones of white, silver, and pale blue, creating a calm, flowing glow rather than a sharp reflection.\n\nWhen held, the light within the metal seems to pulse gently, as though echoing a distant rhythm, giving the ingot a sense of balance between stillness and motion.\n\n---\n## Crafting Use\n- Hybrid weapons (physical + magic)  \n- Balanced armor  \n- Celestial and arcane equipment  \n- Spellcasting focus items  \n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Lightweight with strong structural stability  \n- Maintains balance between opposing energies  \n- Adapts subtly to magical input  \n- Resistant to magical overload or instability  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Exceptional affinity with **Celestial and Arcane** magic  \n- Enhances:\n  - Hybrid enchantments  \n  - Multi-effect enchantments  \n  - Balanced spellcasting systems  \n- Reduces risk of enchantment failure  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +3 Damage Modifier  \n- +3 Armor Modifier  \n- Ideal for hybrid and balanced builds  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Moonstone Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Between light and shadow, it finds its truth.\"*"
