        "route": "/materials/rare/metals/pure-silver-ingot",
        "body": "# Pure Silver Ingot\n\n## Effect\nPure Silver Ingots produce a refined metal that channels Light with exceptional clarity. It excels in purification, protection, and revealing hidden or corrupted forces.\n\n---\n## Appearance\nPure Silver Ingots are smooth and highly refined, with a bright, mirror-like surface that reflects light cleanly and evenly. Unlike other metals, the reflection appears crisp and undistorted, giving it a sense of clarity and purity.\n\nA faint, steady glow lingers along the surface, most noticeable in darkness, as if the metal itself carries a quiet, internal light.\n\n---\n## Crafting Use\n- Holy weapons  \n- Radiant armor  \n- Anti-corruption tools  \n- Divine or celestial equipment  \n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Lightweight and highly refined  \n- Maintains purity under normal conditions  \n- Slightly softer than combat-focused metals  \n- Reacts strongly to corruption and shadow  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Exceptional affinity with **Light** magic  \n- Enhances:\n  - Purification  \n  - Illumination  \n  - Anti-corruption effects  \n- Weak synergy with Dark-aligned enchantments  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +2 Damage Modifier  \n- +3 Armor Modifier  \n- Favours defensive, support, and anti-corruption builds  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Pure Silver Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Where it touches, truth is laid bare.\"*"
