        "route": "/materials/rare/metals/quicksilver-ingot",
        "body": "# Quicksilver Ingot\n\n## Effect\nQuicksilver Ingots produce a highly adaptive metal that enhances speed, precision, and responsiveness. It reacts to both physical movement and magical input, making it ideal for fluid combat styles.\n\n---\n## Appearance\nQuicksilver Ingots appear as perfectly refined bars of reflective metal, their surface constantly shifting with subtle waves and distortions. Despite being solid, they give the impression of barely contained motion.\n\nWhen held, the metal seems to “adjust” slightly, redistributing its form in response to grip, movement, or intent.\n\n---\n## Crafting Use\n- Adaptive weapons  \n- Flexible armor  \n- Arcane tools  \n- Precision-based equipment  \n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Extremely lightweight  \n- Responds instantly to movement and force  \n- Maintains structure despite fluid-like behavior  \n- Less stable under prolonged heavy impact  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- Can be used in adaptive alloy systems (future)\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Exceptional affinity with **Water** and **Air** essences  \n- Enhances:\n  - Speed-based enchantments  \n  - Reactive effects  \n  - Movement and evasion abilities  \n- Supports enchantments that change during combat  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +3 Damage Modifier  \n- +2 Armor Modifier  \n- Favours speed, agility, and reactive combat builds  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Quicksilver Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Strike before thought — and it will follow.\"*"
