        "route": "/materials/epic/metals/dark-stone-ingot",
        "body": "# Dark Stone Ingot\n\n## Effect\nDark Stone is an evolved form of Moonstone, shaped through prolonged exposure to Dark and Death-aligned environments. It enhances suppression, decay, and control over opposing forces.\n\n---\n\n## Appearance\nDark Stone appears as a deep black-grey metal with faint, dim internal movement beneath its surface. Unlike Ebony, it does not absorb all light, but instead dulls it, creating a muted, twilight-like sheen.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nDark Stone forms when Moonstone is exposed to environments saturated with darkness and death energy. This transformation strips away balance, leaving a material aligned with suppression and control.\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Absorbs and dampens energy  \n- Stable under shadow and death influence  \n- Suppresses surrounding magical presence  \n- Performs best in low-light or dark environments  \n\n---\n\n## Evolution Path\n- Origin: [[Moonstone Ingot]]  \n- Requires Dark-aligned refinement process  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Strong affinity with **Dark** and **Death**  \n- Enhances:\n  - Suppression effects  \n  - Debuffs and decay  \n  - Control-based abilities  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +5 Damage Modifier  \n- +3 Armor Modifier  \n- Favours control, suppression, and dark-aligned builds  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Balance was a lie — this is what remains.\"*"
