        "body": "# Duranium Ingot\n\n## Effect\nDuranium Ingots produce a highly resilient metal that absorbs, stabilises, and redistributes force. It adapts to repeated stress, making it one of the most reliable defensive materials available.\n\n---\n\n## Appearance\nDuranium Ingots are dense, dark grey bars with subtle internal movement beneath the surface. When struck, faint waves ripple across the metal before settling.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nOnce refined, Duranium becomes a cornerstone material for defensive equipment and high-end constructs. Its ability to adapt to stress makes it invaluable in prolonged combat and high-impact environments.\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Absorbs and redistributes force  \n- Adapts to repeated impact  \n- Extremely durable under sustained stress  \n- Maintains structural integrity under extreme conditions  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Strong affinity with **Earth** and **Air**  \n- Enhances:\n  - Defensive enchantments  \n  - Stability and reinforcement  \n  - Impact resistance  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +4 Damage Modifier  \n- +5 Armor Modifier  \n- Favours defensive, adaptive, and tank builds  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires 4x [[Duranium Ore]]  \n- Requires high-energy forge  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"It learns every strike — and answers with silence.\"*"
