        "route": "/materials/epic/metals/light-stone-ingot",
        "body": "# Light Stone Ingot\n\n## Effect\nLight Stone is an evolved form of Moonstone, refined under continuous exposure to Light. It amplifies clarity, protection, and purification, making it ideal for defensive and support-oriented equipment.\n\n---\n\n## Appearance\nLight Stone appears as a luminous, pale metal with a soft white and silver glow. Its surface reflects light cleanly, with faint internal radiance that pulses gently beneath it.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nLight Stone forms when Moonstone is exposed to intense Light-aligned environments over extended periods. This process removes its dual nature, leaving behind a purified material aligned entirely with Light.\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Highly stable under magical conditions  \n- Resistant to corruption and decay  \n- Maintains structural clarity under stress  \n- Performs best in Light-aligned environments  \n\n---\n\n## Evolution Path\n- Origin: [[Moonstone Ingot]]  \n- Requires Light-aligned refinement process  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Exceptional affinity with **Light**  \n- Enhances:\n  - Purification  \n  - Defensive effects  \n  - Healing-adjacent enchantments  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +4 Damage Modifier  \n- +5 Armor Modifier  \n- Favours defensive, support, and Light-aligned builds  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"What was once balanced now stands unwavering.\"*"
