        "route": "/materials/mythic/metals/elementium-ingot",
        "body": "# Elementium Ingot\n\n## Effect\nElementium is a harmonised elemental metal capable of conducting and stabilising multiple elemental energies simultaneously. It naturally adapts to the elemental affinity of its wielder while maintaining perfect internal balance.\n\n---\n\n## Appearance\nElementium Ingots possess a smooth metallic surface threaded with constantly shifting elemental colouration. Waves of ember-gold, deep ocean blue, storm silver, and emerald-green move beneath the surface like flowing energy.\n\nThe metal subtly changes depending on nearby elemental forces.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nElementium is considered one of the rarest and most refined elemental materials in existence. Ancient records claim it was first forged within the Astral Crucible by the god-smith Auralon the Starborn.\n\nUnlike most materials, Elementium does not force elemental power into shape — it allows the elements to coexist naturally within its structure.\n\nBecause of this, many believe the metal itself possesses a primitive awareness of balance and harmony.\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Conducts multiple elemental energies simultaneously  \n- Maintains perfect elemental stability  \n- Slowly repairs minor magical instability through exposure to mana  \n- Adapts naturally to surrounding elemental environments  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Exceptional affinity with:\n  - Fire\n  - Water\n  - Earth\n  - Air\n  - Light\n  - Dark\n  - Life\n  - Death\n- Enhances:\n  - Multi-element enchantments  \n  - Mana stability  \n  - Elemental channeling  \n- Difficult to corrupt or destabilise  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +5 Damage Modifier  \n- +5 Armor Modifier  \n- Favours elementalists, hybrid casters, and high-tier magical builds  \n\n---\n\n## Special Interaction\n- Adapts naturally to the wielder’s dominant elemental affinity  \n- Performs exceptionally well under balanced elemental conditions  \n- Can stabilise conflicting elemental enchantments more effectively than most materials  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires 4x [[Elementium Ore]]  \n- Requires astral forge or elemental convergence conditions  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Elementium does not command the elements — it unites them.\"*"
